{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Valiant Citybus Family DLC for OMSI 2 represents the Volvo 7000 and 7700 on B7L, B7LA and B10LA chassis produced between 1998 and 2006. These vehicles proved particularly popular in Eastern Europe, with most examples produced operating in Budapest, Vilnius, Wroclaw and Lodz. However, these vehicles also had a significant career in the rest of Europe, with examples in major cities such as Berlin, Hamburg, Geneva and Nantes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC includes 9 main versions, covering the most common variants, in all lengths and door configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 engines are available, allowing a choice between Diesel and Natural Gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The vehicles are all highly customisable, thanks to 18 SETVARs, chosen to represent a maximum of the many and varied options offered in this vehicle's catalogue. Thanks to these SETVARs, you can create around 600* unique configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The vehicles can be repainted as you like, thanks to the templates included and an explanatory manual. Most of the vehicles that existed have been represented as faithfully as possible**.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743640/extras/omsi_features.png?t=1747915260\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Versions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Lengths: 12m and 17.94m</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Engines: D7C (250 and 290 kW), GH10C (290kW)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Gearboxes: VOITH D863.3E, ZF 5HP552C, ZF 5HP592C</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 3 dashboards available, including a VDO (VDV)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All versions have a default demonstrator type variant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">18 SETVAR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly detailed 3D model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimised textures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the main options are represented in SETVAR (doors, cockpit, mirrors, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At least 2 possible seat configurations per vehicle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VOITH and ZF transmissions available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New air conditioning system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* calculation based on the version with the least SETVAR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">** For the sake of simplicity, the layout of the buttons on the various dashboards is fixed and does not take into account the exotic layouts sometimes offered on certain networks. The on-board systems are also the same for all vehicles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743640?t=1747915260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743640/57c993feb12c88cda2305a2bf96e75ee69297b67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747915260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743640/8877dc54eed410dfe551d3ae4795537724f3c80c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747915260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743640/8877dc54eed410dfe551d3ae4795537724f3c80c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747915260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Valiant Citybus Family DLC for OMSI 2 represents the Volvo 7000 and 7700 on B7L, B7LA and B10LA chassis produced between 1998 and 2006. These vehicles proved particularly popular in Eastern Europe, with most examples produced operating in Budapest, Vilnius, Wroclaw and Lodz. However, these vehicles also had a significant career in the rest of Europe, with examples in major cities such as Berlin, Hamburg, Geneva and Nantes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC includes 9 main versions, covering the most common variants, in all lengths and door configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 engines are available, allowing a choice between Diesel and Natural Gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The vehicles are all highly customisable, thanks to 18 SETVARs, chosen to represent a maximum of the many and varied options offered in this vehicle's catalogue. Thanks to these SETVARs, you can create around 600* unique configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The vehicles can be repainted as you like, thanks to the templates included and an explanatory manual. Most of the vehicles that existed have been represented as faithfully as possible**.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743640/extras/omsi_features.png?t=1747915260\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Versions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Lengths: 12m and 17.94m</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Engines: D7C (250 and 290 kW), GH10C (290kW)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Gearboxes: VOITH D863.3E, ZF 5HP552C, ZF 5HP592C</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 3 dashboards available, including a VDO (VDV)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All versions have a default demonstrator type variant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">18 SETVAR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly detailed 3D model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimised textures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the main options are represented in SETVAR (doors, cockpit, mirrors, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At least 2 possible seat configurations per vehicle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VOITH and ZF transmissions available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New air conditioning system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* calculation based on the version with the least SETVAR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">** For the sake of simplicity, the layout of the buttons on the various dashboards is fixed and does not take into account the exotic layouts sometimes offered on certain networks. The on-board systems are also the same for all vehicles.</p>","developers":["ADIC group"],"fullgame":{"appid":"252530","name":"OMSI 2: Steam Edition"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743640/8930e9b6e272110b3116ea99a0a6a42635776d5c/header.jpg?t=1747915260","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2013 AEROSOFT. All rights reserved. All trademarks and brand names are trademarks or registered trademarks of the respective owners. Copyrights are serious stuff. If you find any pirated copies of this software please notify us. We will make sure reports of copyrights violation are rewarded. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAerosoft GmbH<br />\r\nLindberg